{"_id":"post-matriculation-2025-2026","_type":"post","title":"TSU Matriculates New Students in 17th Ceremony","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"tsu-matriculates-new-students-17th-ceremony"},"category":"campus-life","excerpt":"Taraba State University formally admitted a new batch of students during its 17th matriculation ceremony, marking the start of the 2025/2026 academic session.","body":[{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Taraba State University has formally admitted a new batch of students during its 17th matriculation ceremony, marking the commencement of the 2025/2026 academic session.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"The ceremony, held in Jalingo, drew the Vice-Chancellor, Prof. Sunday Paul Bako, members of university management, deans, heads of departments, and parents. Registrar Dr. Joseph U. Bibinu conducted the formal proceedings.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"In his address, Prof. Bako congratulated the matriculating students and urged them to remain resilient and focused throughout their studies.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]}],"authorNameOverride":"TSU Corporate Affairs","publishedAt":"2026-04-18T12:00:00Z","featured":true}
{"_id":"post-interdept-transfer","_type":"post","title":"TSU Opens Inter-Departmental Transfer Portal for 2025/2026 Session","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"tsu-opens-inter-departmental-transfer-portal"},"category":"academics","excerpt":"The Office of the Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Academic) has opened the inter-departmental transfer portal, with a short and specific application window.","body":[{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Taraba State University has announced the opening of its Inter-Departmental Transfer portal for the 2025/2026 academic session.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"The notice, issued by the Office of the Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Academic), confirmed the portal opened Tuesday, 10 February 2026 and closes Friday, 20 February 2026. Students who miss this window must wait for the next approved period.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]}],"authorNameOverride":"Office of the DVC (Academic)","publishedAt":"2026-02-06T09:00:00Z","featured":false}
{"_id":"post-biometric-capture","_type":"post","title":"Biometric Capture Timetable Announced for 2025/2026 CBT Exams","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"biometric-capture-timetable-2025-2026"},"category":"general","excerpt":"TSU has released the biometric capture timetable for newly admitted and returning students ahead of the 2025/2026 CBT-based examinations.","body":[{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Taraba State University has announced the start of biometric capture for the 2025/2026 CBT-based examinations.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]},{"_type":"block","style":"normal","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"The exercise targets newly admitted students, with separate dates assigned per faculty, and also includes returning students with no previous biometric capture record on file.","marks":[]}],"markDefs":[]}],"authorNameOverride":"TSU Examinations Office","publishedAt":"2026-02-01T09:00:00Z","featured":false}
